  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;function must be continuous</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>differentiability at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Put in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
